Cell["\<\
The interval between two vertices of a grid, two steps apart in each \
direction, drawn by the geodesics through each edge, and the DAG itself.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"31468b2a-cb3b-4f24-86d7-209c171e7fb4"],

